 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi, how are things with you?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.77,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, thanks. Just got home.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My daughter wants to play online with her friends. She's ten and I'm nervous about strangers talking to her.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.6,
   "block": "video_games.dlg6",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's a very reasonable worry. Most consoles have parental controls that let you limit chat to friends you approve.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.72,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg6"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Want a coffee from the machine, Leila?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.47,
   "block": "nq_work_079",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "other_name",
   "phrasing": "nq_work_079",
   "name_pos": "end",
   "addressee": "Leila"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "So she can play with her school friends but not randoms?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 2.73,
   "block": "video_games.dlg6",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Exactly. You can usually set it so only friends can message or voice chat. Some games also have their own chat settings, so check those too.",
   "est_sec": 8.16,
   "gap_before": 1.27,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg6"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What if someone is",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.11,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "video_games.dlg6"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "nasty to her anyway?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.01,
   "block": "video_games.dlg6",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Teach her how to block and report, and make sure she knows she can tell you without getting in trouble. That last part matters most.",
   "est_sec": 7.85,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg6"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Should I sit with her?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.38,
   "block": "video_games.dlg6",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "At first, it's a nice idea. Keeping the console in a shared room, like the living room, makes it easy to keep an eye on things without hovering.",
   "est_sec": 8.78,
   "gap_before": 1.14,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "video_games.dlg6"
  }
 ]
}
